					"nextDialogs": [
						10120803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120803,
					"content": "哦，你们回来了，我也没有等很久。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120804,
					"content": "比起神像所刻的岩王帝君的守望，不过是短短一瞬而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120805,
					"content": "哈哈，人怎么能跟雕像比呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120806,
					"content": "说得也是。如何，你们把香膏带来了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120807,
					"content": "三份香膏，一份不少！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120808,
					"content": "辛苦二位了，我们试着依次供奉上去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120809
					],
					"speakerTitle": "钟离"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120809,
					"content": "（供奉「金屋藏娇」）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10120810,
					"content": "这是第一种香膏，莺儿小姐说它甜蜜梦幻，是小女孩们最喜欢的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120811,
					"content": "（供奉「山阴锦簇」）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10120812,
					"content": "这是第二种香膏，说是贵气凌人，富家千金的最爱。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120813,
					"content": "（供奉「缥缈仙缘」）",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120814
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10120814,
					"content": "第三种香膏，香气轻柔却久久不散，如雾色朦胧…什么什么的，最受成熟女性的欢迎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120815
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120815,
					"content": "欸…刚才那是？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120816,
						10120817
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 10120816,
					"content": "「岩王帝君」很中意的样子。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10120818
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10120818,
					"content": "那是成熟的大姐姐喜欢用的款式吧？",
