					"content": "最后一种香气轻柔却久久不散，如天光昏暗雾色朦胧，最受成熟女性们的欢迎。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121317,
					"content": "记住了吗？可别用错场合呀。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121318,
					"content": "记，记住了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121319
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10121319,
					"content": "好，那需要我帮忙的地方，就到这里了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121320,
					"content": "那么，最后再送你一句话吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121321,
					"content": "想脚踏三条船，可要想好先抬哪只脚…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121322,
					"content": "……",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121323
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10121323,
					"content": "呵呵，有空再来「春香窑」陪陪我吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121309,
					"content": "我刚才只想着你哦。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121310
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 10121310,
					"content": "欸呀，你居然还记得我随口一提的约定吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				},
				{
					"id": 10121311,
					"content": "你比预想中更讨人喜欢呢，若是不当心的话…连我都可能会动心了，呵呵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						10121312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "莺儿"
				}
			]
